Description: MI Linux gaming readiness meta package
 Installs the lightweight default gaming-readiness stack for MI Linux and
 recommends heavier optional gaming, Windows-app, and Android-app tools for
 discovery through APT/GNOME Software/Welcome instead of forcing them onto
 every base install.
